{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"01M6S09BX5DDBXFS8D3EQZG0QR"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$ref":"01M6S74NP84AYJKY8WMVCV1CZS"},"understandings":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NP84AYJKY8WMVCV1CZS"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP9J2K5ACAJRFXWBVYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPA4GXJQ0YFJH4KJP1C"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPBN45GJA8PM0NWJY7B"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPC7MBGZ3S9MMW7P086"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPDHMN5MD0FY6TNQ2EY"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPE7F79RAK0W5S3DBYG"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPFWTHZ66E596SNQQXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPGP8Z5WXCRAPJYBSKB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPHG7J14TDWYZY74T3T"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPJ93HPB3BCRYFB74V2"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPK3BMZGVR81THA9GA8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPM9SXHF2JXHZ68VK4T"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPNQ2DM40M6GN2T7AWQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPP97VBZJG0AMKEDJE1"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPQSAP5XWQBJ69Y685X"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPRSNQTC613ZXGVQW7R"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPS9XR05P14EJ3MRB82"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPTAR0W819NPR038GKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPVJPTMM5TMKXJ4BPY1"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPWTZW1VDK3Z41P2P9R"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPXJQX2BKK5S2YRJ3RC"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPYBGEF7AB8NCNXFHPB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPZVNM9FJ94S6TT4FFV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ0BE2PJXWJATYRE27A"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ1V35R23P5TG3ERQ8Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ2C1J6HVMQJK2YBFN7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ3WC1QPKA3N4ZKS93A"}]},"id":"01M6S74NQ4CWHYVXD5MQV8GKEX","instance":["01M6S74NG0JR8Q2S499AF7FR71"],"kind":"version","name":"branch-07","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where the weight the whole owes is put down","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NP9J2K5ACAJRFXWBVYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPA4GXJQ0YFJH4KJP1C"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPHG7J14TDWYZY74T3T"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPRSNQTC613ZXGVQW7R"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPWTZW1VDK3Z41P2P9R"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ0BE2PJXWJATYRE27A"}],"prose":"The paper sketches a system that owes something to the people it serves and tries to spread that debt across its parts: each part takes on a share, one part binds them, a rehearsal tests them, and a rural road map is where it is meant to land. Much of it is still drawn in intention rather than built.","title":"A whole that answers for its parts"},"id":"01M6S74NP84AYJKY8WMVCV1CZS","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the idea has travelled before this paper picks it up","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08YR2M952H7ZN6R90BBJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S08YV85BZVM4G694CQKMYX"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZXGVT2TSASGV9X2TYHX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090806VNZVA97AV0V0XD2"},{"$ref":"01M6S090GX8FSDRJ0E4TJ1H3DX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090KZCM15DWJFKQVKT5TM"},{"$ref":"01M6S090PDBF0YZFN6YMV9WJ5W"},{"$ref":"01M6S0916BHS51YPSAGK594MMT"},{"$ref":"01M6S0919HQTTW5K4S0JD9BAN6"},{"$ref":"01M6S091CAZDYVGXTAQ2RARAAA"},{"$ref":"01M6S091KTFAT80JBWTQHERM05"}],"prose":"The nested-wholes idea arrives from philosophy through factory floors and spreads into grids, construction and twins; the paper inherits that momentum and the hope that adding learning machines makes the parts smarter.","title":"An inherited paradigm on the move"},"id":"01M6S74NP9J2K5ACAJRFXWBVYC","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which share of the whole's duty each part carries","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NPBN45GJA8PM0NWJY7B"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPC7MBGZ3S9MMW7P086"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPDHMN5MD0FY6TNQ2EY"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPGP8Z5WXCRAPJYBSKB"}],"prose":"Instead of one mind that must be good, careful and wise at once, each virtue becomes a kind of part with its own job, and the parts lean on one another.","title":"The burden shared out as roles"},"id":"01M6S74NPA4GXJQ0YFJH4KJP1C","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"rank against local freedom","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZT4PVPYCGQYJV7PR3M5"},{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"}],"prose":"A part's freedom is bounded by where it sits: the higher it stands the more it may decide, yet the lower ones keep a room of their own.","title":"Authority follows position"},"id":"01M6S74NPBN45GJA8PM0NWJY7B","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the shape of the gap each role is cut to fill","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0912JT6RA5BZ9DA4QWXW0"},{"$ref":"01M6S091HFR7QY67Y0XKA5J0DF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093679WVYX9W76WMQSFYF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093JWWSFCKGZGR3EF21M7"},{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"}],"prose":"Every new kind of part is introduced as the answer to a specific failing of present autonomous systems: harm, short-sightedness, misreading, prejudice, isolation.","title":"Each role born from a named lack"},"id":"01M6S74NPC7MBGZ3S9MMW7P086","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a role judges or senses","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NPE7F79RAK0W5S3DBYG"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPFWTHZ66E596SNQQXA"}],"prose":"The five roles divide into those that weigh a decision and those that perceive the world it is made in.","title":"Roles as checks on deciding"},"id":"01M6S74NPDHMN5MD0FY6TNQ2EY","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which standard a choice is held against","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093C3FHWQ6C5YRWRHZ9BN"},{"$ref":"01M6S093D1G6HQ1AF4PPZ6Z3M4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093FSPTEATFTYCNEJEMQ4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093NFQRR88X9PD990GSFB"},{"$ref":"01M6S093PESAZNQ254MP8QMHMG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S094EZEHMWPGCTN09CMTBK"},{"$ref":"01M6S094G14MVA149MAHGZ3JBG"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S094K282XW4C3DANB6FYG7"}],"prose":"The ethical, effective and unbiased parts each hold a decision against a standard beyond speed: harm, the long run, fairness to the person being decided about.","title":"Weighing roles"},"id":"01M6S74NPE7F79RAK0W5S3DBYG","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of the situation reaches the decider","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0943RC500MSJR3TQ6FQP3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0944TNASX9K8JK5V5RTRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"},{"$ref":"01M6S094QH86CGJ2VPFEPRMBRA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094RFB8ZYRDV9DDW98ERX"},{"$ref":"01M6S094SYAEG8KEJ8AW61YRGQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S094VHECP7DNYBAFKGW3ZP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094XMKX1YC7SH2K1A4ZDZ"}],"prose":"The understanding and vigilant parts make sense of scattered data and keep the whole aware of itself, so that local choices do not drift apart.","title":"Perceiving roles"},"id":"01M6S74NPFWTHZ66E596SNQQXA","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction evaluations flow between roles","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094Z5HFC2AJXX9P288K6H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953C5H9DMB8CRTPS6YK3"}],"prose":"The roles are not parallel silos: judges hand verdicts to the balancer, the interpreters feed the judges, and the watchers span every level.","title":"Roles that feed each other"},"id":"01M6S74NPGP8Z5WXCRAPJYBSKB","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"coordination without uniformity","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NPJ93HPB3BCRYFB74V2"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPK3BMZGVR81THA9GA8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPM9SXHF2JXHZ68VK4T"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPNQ2DM40M6GN2T7AWQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPP97VBZJG0AMKEDJE1"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPQSAP5XWQBJ69Y685X"}],"prose":"One special part is proposed to make the others speak and act together without forcing them into one mould, keeping their inner ways intact.","title":"The binder"},"id":"01M6S74NPHG7J14TDWYZY74T3T","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much each participant must surrender to join","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0957APBWA2W6N7RK4HA1J"},{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"},{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095PBA4ZRBXY1GY14VWHR"},{"$ref":"01M6S095Q6V5YHG5EJ40PT2KHP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S095WN23Y8DRJGK8C24NJV"},{"$ref":"01M6S096NJ1YCGW3GT69CTCK3B"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"}],"prose":"Of three ways to make systems work together, the paper chooses the one with no shared format and no common layer, because the others ask every part to give up its shape.","title":"Refusing a single standard"},"id":"01M6S74NPJ93HPB3BCRYFB74V2","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifespan of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09654M23DFDXTHS52MBXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S097JQCMENMDG4DXR4V4ZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0992KZHB02ZBDX260T244"},{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"}],"prose":"Agreement about words is struck at runtime, used for one exchange and discarded, so newcomers can be understood without a dictionary written in advance.","title":"Meaning made for the moment"},"id":"01M6S74NPK3BMZGVR81THA9GA8","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which organ does what, and which can be removed","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0982Y69VFJ6C8NQBP89NE"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098BNS851MZHX3SFT2NYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"},{"$ref":"01M6S098FH9YH6FMBTFF272DJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S098GRA69D8E61BGJ3ETJF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098HDWNMXMGHDKP7HYH0G"},{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"}],"prose":"Inside, it is a small machine of six organs: a deciding head, a registry graph of capabilities, a translator, a finder, and a pair that plans and runs workflows, the last two optional.","title":"The binder's anatomy"},"id":"01M6S74NPM9SXHF2JXHZ68VK4T","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how conflicts between roles are settled","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0974ESZ3BC4PQGRAQ140D"},{"$ref":"01M6S0976Z3XG1JS1A2VTTTBZN"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"},{"$ref":"01M6S097VCBK9XZ25KFJF0ND5N"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"},{"$ref":"01M6S097ZEDYHSVRT1CRE7YFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0981VVD99XQ72EV84VJE6"}],"prose":"When the careful part and the efficient part want different things, the binder negotiates, arbitrates and reconfigures, and it is meant to do this across organisational lines.","title":"Mediating aims that pull apart"},"id":"01M6S74NPNQ2DM40M6GN2T7AWQ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what the mediator itself puts at risk","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S096929EE6AD520SWDPK4N"},{"$ref":"01M6S098NTTHF9ESCJ8CYMNPR9"},{"$ref":"01M6S098Q89NK293FCZ3EYNTNC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098WFFJ09R57JCXQAZAM3"},{"$ref":"01M6S098YF407XTYGG61RBEPZ7"}],"prose":"A part that carries every exchange becomes the place where standards must be agreed, load piles up and secrets can leak, and traceability is offered as a guard.","title":"The binder's own exposure"},"id":"01M6S74NPP97VBZJG0AMKEDJE1","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where control actually comes to rest","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"},{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"}],"prose":"The design is praised for having no central control, yet the binder ends up as the superholon with the highest authority, its head a language model; the flat promise and the crowned structure sit side by side.","title":"A decentralisation that crowns a top"},"id":"01M6S74NPQSAP5XWQBJ69Y685X","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"who directs the trial run","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NPS9XR05P14EJ3MRB82"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPTAR0W819NPR038GKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPVJPTMM5TMKXJ4BPY1"}],"prose":"Simulation is where the parts try the whole out, and the paper wants parts that do not only play in the rehearsal but steer it.","title":"Rehearsal before acting"},"id":"01M6S74NPRSNQTC613ZXGVQW7R","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the step from being simulated to directing simulation","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091PP1ZZQG6WZ7R3BMA7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S091YM28K8SWNXGQD94QWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BPKS0KGT7SR4GE75ACB"}],"prose":"The lineage runs from agents that are simulated, through agents that assist and monitor simulation, to holons that direct it, with emergence from simple local rules as the inherited intuition.","title":"From agents to steering wholes"},"id":"01M6S74NPS9XR05P14EJ3MRB82","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how far a part may change the run","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092KE6ZMECGQSSQBF90BV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092MRCB5DHW2QJWZCMH6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S092NT1X7H7BGXEJM161WB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092PS96FXNTYW0G07YCMZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S092QP2J2DR6DJZ6E197EW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RHVP4CPW8DAZR8Q3QP"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RXW7KF4BQKGGRPEJTG"},{"$ref":"01M6S092VYEKZR8236TWY9GTNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092WW0PH5GJ4A54XXD3EV"}],"prose":"Steering is graded from parts that merely report, through parts that react and learn, to parts that rewrite the rules and set new goals.","title":"Degrees of steering"},"id":"01M6S74NPTAR0W819NPR038GKV","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between the rehearsal and the real","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099RX7Z7ZGC575Z0RX8W5"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH0YMYNDBY3FA44T68F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH1PWXPQSYN6X82S0CZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B0KJPXKB931FZC1JHE3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B4PEE2MM0G40XAMDENJ"}],"prose":"The rehearsal mirrors the working system part for part, with its own manager under the binder; errors are flagged upward, results invalidated, and the run ends in a reckoning of time, emissions and access.","title":"A shadow of the live system"},"id":"01M6S74NPVJPTMM5TMKXJ4BPY1","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"making an absence visible","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NPXJQX2BKK5S2YRJ3RC"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPYBGEF7AB8NCNXFHPB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPZVNM9FJ94S6TT4FFV"}],"prose":"The landing place is sparse countryside, and the most telling aim is not routing but locating the places that transport has abandoned.","title":"Ground: finding where no one can go"},"id":"01M6S74NPWTZW1VDK3Z41P2P9R","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"detecting what is missing rather than optimising what exists","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099CXGHQV3WHYC9KRGE4P"},{"$ref":"01M6S099H77DWSEH2T534Q8NP8"},{"$ref":"01M6S099K16DKC7EQQ35ANCYXH"},{"$ref":"01M6S099P1AJBBMKJ6BC76WM36"},{"$ref":"01M6S099QDK964CYS5R06EN4WT"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"}],"prose":"Places with no means of travel are to be found from gaps in routes and from zones people avoid, and reported to those who could serve them.","title":"Deserts as the thing to see"},"id":"01M6S74NPXJQX2BKK5S2YRJ3RC","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which concrete actor wears which role","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2VW9MCRGFVA05NDNK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3PSM31D58SR50QBDQS"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3Q6P77FKPS24YHHCNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5BW0BNN3HVZ12K0BPE"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"}],"prose":"Each abstract role is given a body: travellers become interpreting parts, services become fair and effective ones, roads and weather become watched ones, and the binder starts and ends every request.","title":"Roles cast onto travel"},"id":"01M6S74NPYBGEF7AB8NCNXFHPB","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"claimed outcome against shown outcome","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09BAGXSGTE19VJ36NDS5M"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BD7Q7DNEGX5EB0MJ8HK"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BEWR9X5Z7H9RYYS9WNB"}],"prose":"The case closes on benefits stated rather than measured: scale, flexibility, fair access, fewer emissions.","title":"Promised goods"},"id":"01M6S74NPZVNM9FJ94S6TT4FFV","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the distance between what is claimed and what is held up","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ1V35R23P5TG3ERQ8Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ2C1J6HVMQJK2YBFN7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NQ3WC1QPKA3N4ZKS93A"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NPQSAP5XWQBJ69Y685X"}],"prose":"The text shows where the proposal is still being stitched: copied passages, crossed definitions, conclusions that admit no testing, and a hierarchy that slips back in.","title":"Seams in the sketch"},"id":"01M6S74NQ0BE2PJXWJATYRE27A","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether each role has its own evidence","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093C3FHWQ6C5YRWRHZ9BN"},{"$ref":"01M6S093D1G6HQ1AF4PPZ6Z3M4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093QQZ23D7GNGKT5YFGTK"},{"$ref":"01M6S093RJMS7XD707H2868RX0"}],"prose":"The effective role's illustrations are word for word the ethical role's, so the long-run part is shown doing the careful part's work.","title":"Examples worn twice"},"id":"01M6S74NQ1V35R23P5TG3ERQ8Y","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"consistency of the terms the scope rests on","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HBYZ649HND3ZYXDXYT"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HYCF58A43XBQ8GAQ7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S099046TN4NZCBCFH60P0M"}],"prose":"The organisational and technological barriers are described with each other's meanings, and later the paper leans on that distinction to scope its own contribution.","title":"Crossed definitions"},"id":"01M6S74NQ2C1J6HVMQJK2YBFN7","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what remains to be shown","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S099046TN4NZCBCFH60P0M"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BKTDMZ0B76G7C8BX946"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BX3RAPV03PXJHMR2Z5K"}],"prose":"The authors call the roles analytical constructs, deny the case is a validation, and name the lack of empirical work as the limit; the choice of a language model as head is argued by plausibility alone.","title":"Untested by its own account"},"id":"01M6S74NQ3WC1QPKA3N4ZKS93A","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
